# Local-only corporate CA bundle used to make `docker build` work behind a TLS-
# inspecting proxy (see docs/DEPLOY.md "Building behind a TLS-inspecting proxy").
# Never committed and never needed on HF's clean runners — a local dev artifact only.
corp-ca.crt

